# The README's first picture: one review move, start to end. validate now calls a service method
# the branch adds; d opens it, a namesake sits right under it, u shows the customer portal calls
# that one, Enter opens a portal endpoint that needs no authentication, and c brings the review
# back to where it stood.
project polar
merl --review
wait hunk 1/9
key c
wait hunk 2/9
key c
wait hunk 3/9
key c
wait hunk 4/9
sleep 0.5
show
sleep 1.8

key /
sleep 0.2
type@0.08 get_by
sleep 0.3
key Enter
sleep 0.5
key Escape
sleep 0.3
key d
wait LicenseKeyService.get_by_key_or_raise
sleep 1.8

key C-d
sleep 2.0

key /
sleep 0.2
type@0.08 get_or
sleep 0.3
key Enter
sleep 0.4
key u
wait Usages of get_or_raise_by_key
sleep 1.8
key Down Down
sleep 0.3
key Enter
wait customer_portal/endpoints/license_keys.py
sleep 2.8

key c
wait hunk 4/9
sleep 1.8
